          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-21T01:55:14.424Z",
          "html": "<p>Each bullet in \"The short version\" now has an example under it: the Spell line, and what it really does.</p>\n<p>E.g. <code>red if it is a diamond or it is a heart</code> turns every heart black once a library has a heart; <code>para cada artículo en sus artículos</code> is a loop only by order; the jack, queen or king warning works with no agent.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
