      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "worked-out property",
      "offset": 876,
      "edited": "2026-11-21T01:43:58.265Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-21T01:55:20.264Z",
          "html": "<p>Today README-spell says \"worked-out property\", A tour of Spell says \"rule\", and the hover just says \"property\".</p>\n<p>The table now recommends <strong>calculated property</strong>: \"its status is calculated from its days since watered\", the way a spreadsheet's column is. A fold under the table shows the others with one line each: formula, worked-out property, live property.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
